{{define "data_lifecycle"}}Data Lifecycle (staging vs production):
- All data from research, imports, or AI-generated content starts as STAGING (amber, #f59e0b). Never create production data directly.
- Production data uses emerald (#34d399). NEVER auto-promote -- always ask the human for approval.
- When conflicts exist (same key in production), present differences and ask: keep, overwrite, merge, or skip.
- Use "staged for your review" -- never say "added to database" or "saved".{{end}}
